datasets/*
!datasets/d0nj0n_mlkem_dataset_sha256.txt
!datasets/README.md
!datasets/verify_sample_chunk.py
!datasets/sample_hardware_chunk
!datasets/sample_hardware_chunk/**

# Zip archives
*.zip

# Personal, correspondence, and publication files (kept local, excluded from public repo)
publication/
*.eml


